LICENSING NOTE FOR v0.1.0

No open-source/content licence is asserted by this prototype package.

Before publishing this repository for reuse, the repository owner should confirm that they have authority to license the material and select a suitable licence under their organisation's intellectual-property policy.

A permissive licence is likely to suit the stated aim of reuse and adaptation outside the originating organisation. Apache-2.0 is a candidate if the repository is expected to include code as well as instructions and documentation; CC BY 4.0 is a candidate for documentation-only material. This is a project governance decision, not legal advice.

Until a licence is selected, normal copyright applies.
